{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_24_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_24","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春二月，公會紀侯、鄭伯。己巳，及齊侯、宋公、衞侯、燕人戰，齊師、宋師、衞師、燕師敗績。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_24_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_24","textTraditional":"曷為後日？恃外也。其恃外奈何？得紀侯、鄭伯，然後能為日也。內不言戰，此其言戰何？從外也。曷為從外？恃外故從外也。何以不地？近也。惡乎近？近乎圍。郎亦近矣，郎何以地？郎猶可以地也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_24_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_24","textTraditional":"二、三月，葬衞宣公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_24_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_24","textTraditional":"三、夏，大水。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_24_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_24","textTraditional":"四、秋七月。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_24_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_24","textTraditional":"五、冬十月。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}